{
  "comment": "The default apps of the guest image: where each one's source is pinned, the patches and design files apps.py lays over it, how it is built, and where make-image.py puts it. The LineageOS apps come from their lineage-24.0 branch, pinned to a commit; DocumentsUI comes from AOSP at the commit each image's own build was made from (the build's manifest_<build_id>.xml names it), so it matches the framework it runs on. Move a pin by changing its commit and checking that the app's patches still apply (apps.py fetch). The system screens (role \"system\": Settings, PermissionController, PackageInstaller and the share sheet) are AOSP apps too, built the same way at the image's own pins with DSA's design, and stand in place of the published ones. `libraries` are folders of the tree that several of them build from (SettingsLib), patched once before them.",
  "branch": "lineage-24.0",
